{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Handoff state. Plan is WRITTEN — it has a `## Acceptance Criteria` checklist, a `## Testing` section, and file_impact already recorded — but it has NOT been plan-reviewed yet, so there is no attestation and it cannot be claimed.\n\nNext step is simply `rebar review-plan <id>`. Do NOT edit the description or file_impact first: file_impact was deliberately recorded BEFORE review, because setting it afterwards invalidates the attestation and sign-review then refuses to re-sign across a changed plan. That mistake cost three re-reviews earlier in this epic."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788398825663860001,"uuid":"be904eab-6b44-47de-8b56-c57988881b21"}